{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Four friends, a bunch of bombs, and zero mercy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bomba Arena</strong>, the chaotic party multiplayer, you\u2019ll blast your buddies into chaos. With bomb upgrades and crazy items, you\u2019ll drive them mad. In the end, only one player can take the win!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20134 Player Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 online battles only, no single player mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/91817fef15043b020c99896b7fa8a705.avif?t=1763264394\" width=780 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong> \u2013 show off your style before blowing up your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/8a03ef34dfed358fb2795578d5919219.poster.avif?t=1763264394\" width=780 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/8a03ef34dfed358fb2795578d5919219.webm?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/8a03ef34dfed358fb2795578d5919219.mp4?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost your explosive power</strong> \u2013 make it messy and surprise your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/4c89b290f376751d9fa0db43ac289703.poster.avif?t=1763264394\" width=780 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/4c89b290f376751d9fa0db43ac289703.webm?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/4c89b290f376751d9fa0db43ac289703.mp4?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use and combine items &amp; power-ups</strong> \u2013 from tricky gadgets to chaotic effects, every round plays differently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/11b1324c5ceb777a9ef92c15fb166281.poster.avif?t=1763264394\" width=780 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/11b1324c5ceb777a9ef92c15fb166281.webm?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132590/extras/11b1324c5ceb777a9ef92c15fb166281.mp4?t=1763264394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Man Standing</strong> \u2013 test friendships and fight for victory in the most explosive party game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomba Arena</strong> was developed by <strong>indie-squid</strong>, a small indie studio with a big love for chaotic multiplayer action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132590?t=1763264394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/413